## compendium_generation (for the 2-3 NPCs not in the opening scene)
Use the faction context and world facts listed above to create NPCs that feel organic to this world. Compendium NPCs should fill roles that the world needs: faction members, civilians, power figures, or people caught between the forces the world facts describe. Their bios should establish what they want and why they matter — not as explicit agendas, but as subtext a player would infer from knowing them.

